{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:102297","published":"2026-11-23T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-25T15:30:14.527185414Z","related":["CVE-2026-126714","CVE-2026-127960","CVE-2026-128064","CVE-2026-128090","CVE-2026-129289","CVE-2026-129291","CVE-2026-129292","CVE-2026-129496","CVE-2026-129506","CVE-2026-129538","CVE-2026-15353"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-126714","CVE-2026-127960","CVE-2026-128064","CVE-2026-128090","CVE-2026-129289","CVE-2026-129291","CVE-2026-129292","CVE-2026-129496","CVE-2026-129506","CVE-2026-129538","CVE-2026-15353"],"summary":"Critical: php security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"PHP is an HTML-embedded scripting language commonly used with the Apache HTTP Server.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * php: PHP-CGI out-of-bounds read and write during PATH_INFO correction (CVE-2026-129538)\n  * php: Timezone cache use-after-free can lead to remote code execution (CVE-2026-129496)\n  * php: PHP-FPM epoll use-after-free can lead to local privilege escalation (CVE-2026-129291)\n  * php: PHP-FPM request smuggling through an unread HTTP request body) (CVE-2026-129289)\n  * php: PHP-FPM status endpoint XSS via unescaped user and script fields) (CVE-2026-129292)\n  * php: PHAR OpenSSL signature bypass via algorithm downgrade (CVE-2026-128090)\n  * php: SOAP information disclosure through malformed array dimensions) (CVE-2026-15353)\n  * php: SOAP use-after-free when processing DTD entity references (CVE-2026-129506)\n  * php: Partially overwritten session files can lead to remote code execution (CVE-2026-126714)\n  * php: Mixed-case HTTPS and FTPS URLs can expose data in plaintext (CVE-2026-128064)\n  * php: Denial of service through folded HTTP response headers (CVE-2026-127960)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Backport security fixes from 8.2.36 to 8.0 [9.9.z] (JIRA:RHEL-310275)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"php","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/php"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.30-8.el9_9.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102297.json"}},{"package":{"name":"php-bcmath","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/php-bcmath"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.30-8.el9_9.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102297.json"}},{"package":{"name":"php-cli","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/php-cli"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.30-8.el9_9.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102297.json"}},{"package":{"name":"php-common","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/php-common"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.30-8.el9_9.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102297.json"}},{"package":{"name":"php-dba","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/php-dba"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.30-8.el9_9.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102297.json"}},{"package":{"name":"php-dbg","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/php-dbg"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.30-8.el9_9.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:102297.json"}},{"package":{"name":"php-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux